    "Title": "Combat Gauntlet - Scenario #6",
    "TitleKey": "GFS_ShipWaveAttack_Mission06_Title",
    "Description": "Congrats on completing part five of this eight-part course.\n\nI\u2019m bringing out the big guns for scenario six. Time for you to go up against larger, multi-crewed ships, which provide a few new challenges. Not only will you have to contend with their enhanced firepower but their multifaceted shields means you\u2019ll have to target one shield face continually to do real damage. Easier said than done when both of y\u2019all are moving at such fast speeds.      \n\nFind your way to <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4> whenever you're ready.\n\nAs a bonus, successful completion of the scenario will net the original contractor holder an award of <EM4>~mission(ScripAmount) MG Scrip</EM4>. \n\nTRICKS OF THE TRADE:\n- Size Advantage \u2013 When going up against a larger ship, try to stay away from their front as typically this is where the majority of their offensive fire is located. \n\nGood luck out there, \nInstructor Gilly     \n\n\nABOUT GILLY\u2019S FLIGHT SCHOOL   \nInstructor Lucas \u201cGilly\u201d Baramsco has served in six squadrons and has over ten years of teaching experience. Whether a student with zero flight experience or a professional looking to polish their skills, Gilly Flight School offers a variety of courses to \u201cLaunch Your Piloting Career.\u201d",
    "DescriptionKey": "GFS_ShipWaveAttack_Mission06_Desc",
    "DisplayDescription": "Congrats on completing part five of this eight-part course.\n\nI\u2019m bringing out the big guns for scenario six. Time for you to go up against larger, multi-crewed ships, which provide a few new challenges. Not only will you have to contend with their enhanced firepower but their multifaceted shields means you\u2019ll have to target one shield face continually to do real damage. Easier said than done when both of y\u2019all are moving at such fast speeds.      \n\nFind your way to <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4> whenever you're ready.\n\nAs a bonus, successful completion of the scenario will net the original contractor holder an award of <EM4>[ScripAmount] MG Scrip</EM4>. \n\nTRICKS OF THE TRADE:\n- Size Advantage \u2013 When going up against a larger ship, try to stay away from their front as typically this is where the majority of their offensive fire is located. \n\nGood luck out there, \nInstructor Gilly     \n\n\nABOUT GILLY\u2019S FLIGHT SCHOOL   \nInstructor Lucas \u201cGilly\u201d Baramsco has served in six squadrons and has over ten years of teaching experience. Whether a student with zero flight experience or a professional looking to polish their skills, Gilly Flight School offers a variety of courses to \u201cLaunch Your Piloting Career.\u201d",
